Nacre procedural demo wallpapers

The geometry and light fields in demo-wallpapers.py are original artwork authored
for Nacre in 2026. No stock images, image-generator output, traced artwork or
external wallpaper collection is used. The Python implementation follows the
repository software license. Its generated wallpaper images are dedicated to the
public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, including commercial use and redistribution.

CC0 1.0 legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
No attribution is required; "Nacre procedural collection" is appreciated.
